# test/screenshots/

Screenshots will be saved here by the GitHub Actions test runner at 5s, 15s, 30s, 45s, 60s, 75s and 90s after page load, plus a final full-page screenshot.

# test/logs/

Test logs will be saved here:
- `console.log` — all browser console output
- `network.log` — all network requests and responses
- `service-worker.log` — Service Worker messages (AMF interception logs)
- `summary.txt` — test summary with pass/fail status
